{"id":"418846","name":"南瓜百合甜汤","author":"咖啡。摩卡","authorId":"6038295","desc":"","cover":"images/418846/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"贝贝南瓜","amount":"1 个{500克左右}"},{"name":"百合","amount":"1个"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"1块"}],"sub":[{"name":"枸杞","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/418846/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"枸杞用水稍泡片刻。","img":"images/418846/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"南瓜洗净去瓤。","img":"images/418846/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"削皮，再切成块。","img":"images/418846/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"百合剥瓣处理。","img":"images/418846/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将两样食材一起放入锅里。","img":"images/418846/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再加一小块冰糖，甜度自己掌握。","img":"images/418846/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加满冷水。大火煮沸后，转小火煮至熟软。","img":"images/418846/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅时撒些枸杞，完成~!","img":"images/418846/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"秋天干燥容易上火，多喝些滋润甜汤哦~~","img":"images/418846/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}